<title>SWEDEN: RESEARCH ALERT - Volvo upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Volvo upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said it upgraded AB Volvo to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- In a report, Deutsche Morgan cited Volvo's &quot;better-than-expected fourth quarter profits and good outlook for 1997.&quot;</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 3/8 to 24-1/2 in U.S. trading.</p>
</text>
